":"b-sanguozhi-061","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-061-lukai"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01","text":"《吴录》曰：旧拜庙，选兼大将军领三千兵为卫，凯欲因此兵以图之，令选曹白用丁奉。皓偶不欲，曰：「更选。」凯令执据，虽蹔兼，然宜得其人。皓曰：「用留平。」凯令其子祎谋语平。平素与丁奉有隙，祎未及得宣凯旨，平语祎曰：「闻野猪入丁奉营，此凶徵也。」有喜色。祎乃不敢言，还，因具启凯，故辍止。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01:m0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"凯","kind":"person","person_id":"61q_ogq_ueq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"丁奉","kind":"person","person_id":"nd1_eoc_wrb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01:m0039","start":39,"end":40,"surface":"皓","kind":"person","person_id":"05e_9bb_55a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01:m0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"凯","kind":"person","person_id":"61q_ogq_ueq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01:m0066","start":66,"end":67,"surface":"皓","kind":"person","person_id":"05e_9bb_55a","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01:m0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"留平","kind":"person","person_id":"uqc_ejd_tc4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01:m0075","start":75,"end":76,"surface":"凯","kind":"person","person_id":"61q_ogq_ueq","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01:m0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"祎","kind":"person","person_id":"61q_ogq_ueq_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line046-pei01-01:m0